## 10up Scaffold Alignment

Reference: [10up WP Scaffold](https://github.com/10up/wp-scaffold)

### Directory Structure Conventions

**When 10up scaffold detected, follow exactly:**

```
project-root/
├── mu-plugins/
│   └── 10up-plugin/                 # Functionality lives here
│       ├── includes/
│       │   ├── blocks/              # Custom blocks (if functionality)
│       │   ├── classes/
│       │   └── functions/
│       ├── composer.json
│       └── package.json
│
├── themes/
│   └── 10up-theme/                  # Presentation lives here
│       ├── blocks/                  # Blocks (presentation layer)
│       ├── components/              # Reusable components
│       ├── patterns/                # Block patterns
│       ├── parts/                   # Template parts (FSE)
│       ├── templates/               # Templates (FSE)
│       ├── assets/
│       │   ├── css/
│       │   └── js/
│       ├── theme.json              # FSE configuration
│       ├── composer.json
│       └── package.json
│
├── package.json                     # Root package.json (workspaces)
├── composer.json                    # Root composer.json
└── .husky/                          # Git hooks
```

