## Block Development Patterns

### block.json Structure (Block API v3)

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://schemas.wp.org/trunk/block.json",
  "apiVersion": 3,
  "name": "tenup/accordion",
  "title": "Accordion",
  "category": "common",
  "icon": "list-view",
  "description": "An accessible accordion component for FAQ sections.",
  "keywords": ["accordion", "faq", "collapsible"],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "textdomain": "tenup",
  "attributes": {
    "items": {
      "type": "array",
      "default": []
    },
    "allowMultiple": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": false
    }
  },
  "supports": {
    "html": false,
    "anchor": true,
    "align": ["wide", "full"],
    "color": {
      "background": true,
