          <!-- /wp:group -->
        </div>
        <!-- /wp:group -->
      </div>
      <!-- /wp:group -->
    ',
  ]
);
```

### Pattern with Core Blocks Strategy

**Lean on Core Decision Tree:**

```
Component Request
    ↓
Can core blocks handle this?
    ├─ Yes → Create Block Pattern
    │   ├─ Use Group blocks for structure
    │   ├─ Use core blocks for content
    │   ├─ Add custom CSS for behavior
    │   └─ Result: No custom PHP/JS needed
    │
    └─ No → Evaluate custom block need
        ├─ Simple enhancement needed?
        │   └─ Pattern + minimal JS
        │
        └─ Complex functionality?
            └─ Custom Gutenberg Block
```

